# Cloudflare Pages redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Every "Find your market" / Market Intelligence Tool link on the website points
# at /app, and this line sends it on to the app. It is the ONLY place the app's
# address is written: when the real domain is known, change it here and nothing
# else needs editing.
#
# 302 (temporary) rather than 301 so browsers don't cache it — the address can
# change without stale redirects lingering in visitors' browsers.
/app  https://app.example.org/  302
